data: {"content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_154987","logprobs":[],"output_index":0,"sequence_number":251,"text":"The Workboard application now meets all cumulative requirements for **Task 001**:\n\n* Home page shows **Workboard** heading, a textbox labelled **Project name**, and a **Create project** button.\n* Blank or whitespace‑only project names trigger a visible alert with **Project name is required** and do not add a project.\n* Projects are displayed in creation order, each in a row with `data-testid=\"project-row\"` and an **Open project** button.\n* Opening a project navigates to `/projects/\u003cid\u003e`, shows the project name as a heading, and includes a **Projects** button to return to the list.\n* Project data persists across reloads and server restarts using SQLite at `DB_PATH`.\n* Health endpoint `GET /health` returns `{\"status\":\"ok\"}` with HTTP 200.\n* The server starts with `npm start`, binds to `0.0.0.0` on `PORT` (default 8080), and uses only the built‑in Node.js modules.\n\nAll source changes are committed. The current commit SHA is:\n\n**6686eef9adf726f2635295f0541d28d4a28533c5**.","type":"response.output_text.done"}

event: response.content_part.done
data: {"content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_154987","output_index":0,"part":{"annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"The Workboard application now meets all cumulative requirements for **Task 001**:\n\n* Home page shows **Workboard** heading, a textbox labelled **Project name**, and a **Create project** button.\n* Blank or whitespace‑only project names trigger a visible alert with **Project name is required** and do not add a project.\n* Projects are displayed in creation order, each in a row with `data-testid=\"project-row\"` and an **Open project** button.\n* Opening a project navigates to `/projects/\u003cid\u003e`, shows the project name as a heading, and includes a **Projects** button to return to the list.\n* Project data persists across reloads and server restarts using SQLite at `DB_PATH`.\n* Health endpoint `GET /health` returns `{\"status\":\"ok\"}` with HTTP 200.\n* The server starts with `npm start`, binds to `0.0.0.0` on `PORT` (default 8080), and uses only the built‑in Node.js modules.\n\nAll source changes are committed. The current commit SHA is:\n\n**6686eef9adf726f2635295f0541d28d4a28533c5**.","type":"output_text"},"sequence_number":252,"type":"response.content_part.done"}

